  "description": "Baek Sa-Rang, who feels comfortable eating, going to the movies, and drinking alone, is alone. Yoo Pyeong-Hwa, who longs to socialize with others, even at a loss. Love and Pyeong-Hwa, who have lived contrasting lives, meet each other and discover a new way of life. This is a realistic romance that's both more mature than you might think, yet more childish than you might think, yet relatable.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
